<title>JAPAN: Sony's shares fall after yen rises against dlr.</title>
<headline>Sony's shares fall after yen rises against dlr.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Sony Corp fell sharply in early Friday morning trade as the yen's rise against the dollar prompted investors to take profits, brokers said.</p>
<p>The blue-chip exporter's shares were down 310 yen at 8,580 yen at 0041 GMT.</p>
